OL,3,GNEWSAThe quaint woodlands with a
OL,4,Awartime past
OL,5,
OL,6,FNestled in one of the highest points in
OL,7,FKent is Ide Hill, a village with a
OL,8,Fwartime past that locals are determined
OL,9,Fto get to the bottom of.
OL,11,FThe village, which is around three
OL,12,Fmiles from Sevenoaks, sits near some
OL,13,Fwoodlands that, uncharacteristically,
OL,14,Fhave paved paths peeking through the
OL,15,Fearth.
OL,17,FPhil Richards, a researcher from nearby
OL,18,FDunton Green, learned more about why
OL,19,Fwhen speaking to a lady he met while
OL,20,Fout walking his dog.
OL,23,APub: 11-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
